WEBVTT

00:03.000 --> 00:07.000
When I play, I can do amazing things.

00:07.000 --> 00:13.000
I can run, I can jump, and I'm still learning to do more.

00:13.000 --> 00:18.500
Special Olympics Young Athletes help young children around the world discover their abilities

00:18.500 --> 00:24.000
and develop their strengths through the power of sport and play.

00:24.000 --> 00:29.500
Young Athletes introduces basic sport skills like kicking and throwing through fun activities

00:29.500 --> 00:36.000
to children with and without intellectual disabilities ages 2 to 7.

00:36.000 --> 00:40.000
Children of all ability levels participate and they all benefit.

00:40.000 --> 00:47.000
They develop important motor skills, grow stronger, build confidence at every milestone,

00:47.000 --> 00:52.000
and learn to interact and communicate with others.

00:52.000 --> 00:58.000
Family share in the fun and learn to support their child's development.

00:58.000 --> 01:02.000
And everyone learns acceptance and friendship.

01:02.000 --> 01:09.000
With activities in more than 125 countries, Young Athletes reach children around the world.

01:09.000 --> 01:15.000
Giving families, communities, and schools the tools to create inclusive environments

01:15.000 --> 01:20.750
and help children of all abilities unlock their potential and envision brighter hopes

01:20.750 --> 01:24.000
for the future.

01:25.000 --> 01:27.000
I loved to play.

01:27.000 --> 01:33.000
It makes me happy to play with friends and it helps me be the best I can be.

01:33.000 --> 01:37.000
So come on, let's play together.
